      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The laryngeal dystonia is often confuse with asthma. But their association in the same patient is possible. In this case the diagnosis is not easy. The management of asthma involves the treatment of the laryngeal dystonia. Failing to have a curative treatment of the dystonia, the anticholinergic by nebulisation are important in the management of the spells and to control asthma."},
